  m_Name: unit_850828
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  unitName: Lightspur Bruiser Kelsa
  unitId: 850828
  unitNumber: 8621
  description: Swaggering Rooster, one of the celestial creatures competing in Emperor
    Yu's search for a trusted assistant, was eager to show off her martial prowess
    in a world without warfare. With her flair for showiness and the right amount
    of intimidation, Kelsa was admitted into the blood-soaked underbelly of the concrete
    jungle. A veritable den of vicious villainy...and yet, an opportunity to sharpen
    long-dulled spurs.It came as no surprise that a woman named after a particular
    breed of bruisers would be anything less than a runaway hit in the ring. After
    a stunning first bout which left her opponent blacked out on the floor, the match
    offers came pouring in. Kelsa took it all in stride. Back in Heaven such violence
    was reserved only for times of great peril, but the last war was several hundred
    years ago over a miscreant of a monkey. It was long past time to get cracking.While
    her hulking competition prioritized brute, overwhelming strength, Kelsa took
    advantage of her natural agility and discerning eye for weak spots, sealing her
    wins with a decisive heel drop. Sure, these aren't the villains she was accustomed
    to dealing with, but humbling hubristic humans made for quite the rush. Better
    yet, no one had to die.Throughout her fast-rising "career", Kelsa came to know
    of another celestial presence in the city, though Snake (who now called herself
    Rhyne) preferred not to draw blood in her own performances. The two still hang
    out to this day; there would certainly be quite a turnout should the two pull
    off an aggressive routine on stage...or holding their own against one of the
    many opponents Kelsa has publicly humiliated.
  summonDesc: What? Dance classes?<br>You wanna dance, you should look for Rhyne.<br>I
    just hit people who deserve it.
  fusionDesc: See, if you wrap it this way,<br>it provides better support and won't
    come off.<br>AND it cushions the inevitable crunch.
  evoDesc: It's not the same as kicking <br>bad-guy behind, but close enough!<br>Who's
    next?
  element: 5
  rarity: 7
